  "caveats": [
    "Kerygmachela uses the2018 interpretation: one median long tail and two low ventrolateral kidney-like eyes, not paired tails or stalked camera eyes. Eleven flap pairs peak at fourth/fifth;44 low axial tubercles. Raw frontal prefix18 includes two appendages plus16spines, not18appendages.",
    "Pambdelurion whole-body gate genuinely resolved with Young/Vinther2017 original specimen plates, not oralcone paper alone. Eleven flap/leg pairs are reconstructed; selected six inner spines per appendage are arranged as three pairs.16 marginal oral plate cues are a simplified selected count based on inferred approximately16, not universal exact biology. No eyes invented.",
    "Aegirocassis is Early Ordovician. Eleven trunksegments with ten paired dorsal/ventral flap stations. Two seven-podomere small support appendages each bear five long filter endites;70 main setae each,700 total. Fine secondary microspinules omitted.120 blade cues are spread across10 dorsal bands, not120 biological bands. Eyes inferred, not preserved.",
    "Arthropleura is an unknown-species juvenile interpretation informed by MNHN.F.SOT002123,39.8mm. No giant adult A.mammata extrapolation.24 dorsal units;38 leg pairs preserved and44 reconstructed. Actual model44 pairs,8 leg articles and7 clearly bulging antenna articles. Seven antennal articles follow the paper CT conclusion, best shown in SOT002118 Fig5B; not every article is claimed preserved in target SOT002123. Pigment, pose and relief artistic; model not an exact fossil cast.",
    "All dimensions are measured on final transformed geometry. Nominal art targets are not converted into arbitrary microscopic acceptance gates. Contact/exposure includes each closed island against actual global solids; sampled visibility still needs actual pixel review.",
    "Consult-only source media remain local and are not redistributed in Git. No source image, third-party mesh or texture incorporated. CPU stills and Node parsing are not GPU or composed-scene proof."
  ],
  "independent_review_focus": [
    "Review all32 separate final512px PNGs, four necessary exact-subject details and four lossless sheets. Sheets never substitute individual full frames.",
    "Check primary specimens separately from reconstructions, the Pambdelurion whole-body reference gate, the2018 Kerygmachela tail/eyes, Ordovician Aegirocassis double-flap/filter anatomy and juvenile-bounded Arthropleura scope.",
    "Check Arthropleura r009 head detail and actual seven antennal bulge maxima; old r007 final pictures were rejected and retained locally.",
    "Check all ten Aegirocassis filtering endites and700 individual setal islands, actual contacts and global exposure. Parent-only exposure was not accepted.",
    "Use original decoded GLB triangles for winding verification. No corrected/welded surrogate is certified. Rebuilds have separate recorded process IDs and semantic hashes.",
    "Interpret raw feature prefix counts with the anatomical-count-interpretation report to avoid conflating spines with appendages, blade cues with bands or single legs with pairs."
  ],
